    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/f4f7e3bc32b9d7ef6a201067d913ab57.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/f4f7e3bc32b9d7ef6a201067d913ab57.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/f4f7e3bc32b9d7ef6a201067d913ab57.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/a952a238253418ab40d5ba21061fd67e.avif?t=1720810658\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smooth <strong>High-Velocity</strong> Platformer Movement<br></li><li>Change the game world by <strong>Creating/Destroying Objects</strong><br></li><li><strong>Obtainable Gear</strong> (Hats, Gloves, Shoes) changes up gameplay.<br></li><li>Find <strong>Hidden Collectables</strong> in every stage to <strong>Unlock Challange Stages.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Level Objectives</strong> reward multiple completions of stages.<br></li><li><strong>Velocity Runs</strong> encourage you to creatively &quot;break&quot; stages for record times.<br></li><li>Dominate <strong>Enemy/Boss Encounters</strong> using every ability available.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/0ec9925b13b4150ec696d61e28ad3351.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/0ec9925b13b4150ec696d61e28ad3351.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/0ec9925b13b4150ec696d61e28ad3351.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Go Rollo Go</strong> is a high-velocity 2D Platformer where the world is yours to control. <strong><u>RIP</u></strong> sections out of the world and <strong><u>REPLACE</u></strong> them with chunks that allow faster movement and combat advantage. <strong><u>REARRANGE</u></strong> environmental objects like flippers and platforms to propel you forward. <strong><u>ROTATE</u></strong> the World and Gravity at any time to zoom past traps or enemies. <strong><u>ROLL</u></strong> your way around awesome loops to snag collectables. Its all <strong>PHYSICS </strong>so every <strong>ZIP</strong>, <strong>FLIP</strong>, <strong>GRIP</strong> and <strong>DIP</strong> is totally in your control.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/862b77a7bc6134784039b77b83fdcae2.avif?t=1720810658\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/1c463f5f00af64a01af0ec343f04b331.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=300 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/1c463f5f00af64a01af0ec343f04b331.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/1c463f5f00af64a01af0ec343f04b331.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>RIP</u></strong> can be used to find secrets, avoid hazards, and even speed up course times by removing pieces of the world at will.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/b1cab68875fa37906a880811c9a2f9bb.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=300 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/b1cab68875fa37906a880811c9a2f9bb.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/b1cab68875fa37906a880811c9a2f9bb.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><strong><u>REPLACE</u></strong> non-existent or treacherous terrain with your own safe passage. Drop physical objects to harm enemies or create landings. Created objects have a variety of uses. Keep your eyes open for surprising oppotunites.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/dc7c8629f8389b7a37165ca56f04be9c.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=300 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/dc7c8629f8389b7a37165ca56f04be9c.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/dc7c8629f8389b7a37165ca56f04be9c.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>REARRANGE</u></strong> objects in the world to improve your run. Take a free ride by raising/lowering platforms. Get a crazy boost of speed by triggering flippers. Fire away with aimable launchers and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/51977e8881d5d0cfa2a5370dfe34c59a.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=300 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/51977e8881d5d0cfa2a5370dfe34c59a.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/51977e8881d5d0cfa2a5370dfe34c59a.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>ROTATE </u></strong> the world to dodge traps and gain ground. Shave those clear times in half by finding perfect angles to free fall your way through levels. Spin your way through fast-paced <strong>MAZE LEVELS</strong> inspired by arcade classics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/35833fbc684189a27496629dd8143048.poster.avif?t=1720810658\" width=300 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/35833fbc684189a27496629dd8143048.webm?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848300/extras/35833fbc684189a27496629dd8143048.mp4?t=1720810658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>ROLL</u></strong> your way into narrow or hidden spaces to scavenge items and secrets. Scale vertical surfaces with no problem and zip around loops at high speeds.<br><br>",
